      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like the idea of a mailing system with friends. Messages could work for both online and offline users, where online friends will receive a mail notification right away and offline friends will be notified the next time they connect. To prevent spam maybe  you can only edit your sent mail until it is read, at which point you would be able to send them a new message.\n\nPerhaps having it be opt-in and then adding a \"Block Mail\" button for individual friends would make the most sense, but that may be making things too complicated.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
